{"unit_id":"tag:0FPK:proof","translation":"由注记 <REF_0001> 中的构造，可见顺时针绕图（diagram）一周，映射（map）\n<MATH_0001>\n伴随（adjoint）于映射（map）\n<MATH_0002>。\n由引理 <REF_0002>，这也等于 <MATH_0003>。逆时针绕行，得到映射（map），伴随（adjoint）于映射（map）<MATH_0004> 的。由引理 <REF_0003>，这也等于 <MATH_0005>。现在，考察下图（diagram）即可完成证明：\n<MATH_0006>。\n此图（diagram）中的所有多边形（polygons）都交换（commute）。最上面的那个交换（commutes），由引理 <REF_0004>。包含两个朴素（naive）杯积（products）的方块（square）交换（commutes），因为 <MATH_0007> 对复形（complex），由模（modules）组成的，具有函子性（functorial）。对于涉及两个映射（maps）<MATH_0008> 的方块（square）也类似。最后，剩余方块（square）的交换性（commutativity）在复形（complexes）层面成立，并可视为朴素（naive）杯积（product）的定义（利用伴随性（adjointness），对于 <MATH_0009> 和 <MATH_0010>）。证明完成，因为沿此图（diagram）最外圈绕行，得到的就是上面给出的两个映射（maps）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"polygons","target_term":"多边形"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"naive","target_term":"朴素"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"杯积"},{"source_term":"square","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"square","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"square","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"commutativity","target_term":"交换性"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"naive","target_term":"朴素"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"杯积"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_t