{"unit_id":"tag:0FPM:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。注记 <REF_0001> 的相对杯积（relative cup product）是交换（commutative）的，意指图（diagram）\n<MATH_0002>\n在 <MATH_0003> 中交换（commutative），对所有 <MATH_0004>，属于 <MATH_0005> 的。这里 <MATH_0006> 为交换约束（commutativity constraint），作用于导出范畴（derived category）（引理 <REF_0002>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"commutativity constraint","target_term":"交换约束"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"相对杯积所属的态射"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积","context":"注记定义的相对杯积"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"杯积及比较图的交换性"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"交换性比较图"},{"source_term":"commutativity constraint","target_term":"交换约束","context":"导出范畴的交换约束"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"交换约束所在范畴"}],"notes":[]}
