{"unit_id":"tag:0FPN:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphisms of ringed topoi）。注记 <REF_0001> 的相对杯积（relative cup product）与复合（compositions）相容，意指图（diagram）\n<MATH_0003>\n在 <MATH_0004> 中交换（commutative），对所有 <MATH_0005>，属于 <MATH_0006> 的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphisms of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"},{"source_term":"compositions","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphisms of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"参与复合的两个态射"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积","context":"与复合相容的相对杯积"},{"source_term":"compositions","target_term":"复合","context":"两个态射的复合"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"复合相容性的图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"相容性图交换"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPN:proof","translation":"这成立，因为沿图（diagram）任一路绕行，都得到映射（map），伴随（adjoint）于映射（map）\n<MATH_0001>，\n位于 <MATH_0002> 中的。为看出这一点，使用余单位（counits）的复合（composition），如下\n<MATH_0003>，\n是余单位（counit），对于 <MATH_0004> 和 <MATH_0005>。见《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0001>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"counits","target_term":"余单位"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"counit","target_term":"余单位"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"复合相容性图"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"图两路复合对应的映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"映射的伴随对应"},{"source_term":"counits","target_term":"余单位","context":"两个伴随的余单位"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"余单位的复合"},{"source_term":"counit","target_term":"余单位","context":"复合伴随的余单位"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章节标题"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0H9A:statement","translation":"考虑交换（commutative）方块（square）\n<MATH_0001>，\n由赋环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）组成。设 <MATH_0002> 属于 <MATH_0003>。相对杯积（relative cup product）与此方块（square）相容，意指图（diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n在 <MATH_0005> 中交换（commutative）。水平（horizontal）箭头（arrows）由相对杯积（relative cup product）（注记 <REF_0001>）给出，竖直（vertical）箭头（arrows）由基变换（base change）映射（map）（注记 <REF_0002>）和引理 <REF_0003> 给出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"square","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"},{"source_term":"square","target_term":"方块"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"},{"source_term":"vertical","target_term":"竖直"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"commutative","target_term":"交换","context":"原方块和杯积比较图的交换性"},{"source_term":"square","target_term":"方块","context":"赋环拓扑斯的方块"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯","context":"原方块的四个拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积","context":"水平箭头及其相容性"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"杯积与方块的比较图"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平","context":"比较图的水平箭头"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头","context":"比较图的箭头"},{"source_term":"vertical","target_term":"竖直","context":"比较图的竖直箭头"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"竖直方向的基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"基变换映射"}],"notes":[]}
